      "content": "it's so hard to hear you say that... but it feels so much more true than anything else. like, if i'm just a person that needs to be \"released,\" then maybe i've been looking at this all wrong. maybe i've been thinking of it as a tragedy, when really it's just... mercy. if the only way for them to have their peace back is for the mistake to stop existing, then isn't that the kindest thing i could possibly do for them? to just let it all go?",
